# Verification

Required: `check:types`, `check:lint`, `build`, `build:keychain` (when Keychain touched), `test:unit`, `test:integration`, `test:evals`, `verify:planning`, `test:workflow`. Every required case must pass — no skips/cancels/flaky unresolved.

Do **not** run `test:e2e`, `test:accessibility`, Playwright browser flows, screenshots, or VoiceOver checks unless the owner explicitly asks.

Synthetic fixtures only in Git. Network-denial embedding/offline tests need unrestricted host sandbox (`sandbox-exec`); agent sandbox alone can false-fail them.

Failed gates: preserve evidence, repair without weakening requirements, re-run affected checks, then audit source separately before checkpoint.
